{"rpid": "271159505", "root": "271159274", "parent": "271159274", "uname": "又不up有你何用", "mid": "2630589", "level": 6, "vip": 0, "content": "这个游戏就是捏他美索不达米亚和旧约里的塔的故事。（King James bible我翻译一下）\n1. And the whole world had one language and one speech.\n全世界只有一个语言和一种语法。\n2. And it happened that as they moved eastward, they found a plain in Shinar and settled there.\n他们（人类，苏美尔人）向东迁徙，他们找到了shiner平原并在那里安定了下来。\n3. They said to each other, “Come, let’s make bricks and bake them thoroughly.” They used brick instead of stone, and tar for mortar.\n他们说，让我们烧砖做瓦，不再用石头，不再用焦油代替泥浆。\n4. And they said, “Come, let us build ourselves a city, and a tower whose top is in the heavens; let us make a name for ourselves, lest we are scattered abroad over the face of the whole earth.”\n他们说‘我们来建造一座城市，和一座可以直达天堂（早期致伊甸园）的塔。让我们为自己正名，并避免人类在分散到世界各地流离失所。", "like": 8, "ctime": 1496080108, "rcount": 0, "ip": "", "images": [], "video_aid": "416309", "video_bvid": "BV1rx411F7yF", "video_title": "【OP】 Ar tonelico III", "video_desc": "魔塔大陆3 终结世界的少女诗歌 OP", "video_owner": "秋名山退役车神", "video_view": 19767, "video_reply": 68, "video_n1": 40, "video_n2": 28}
{"rpid": "271159557", "root": "271159274", "parent": "271159274", "uname": "又不up有你何用", "mid": "2630589", "level": 6, "vip": 0, "content": "5. But the Lord came down to see the city and the tower which the sons of men had built.\n但是主（美索不达米亚版本应该是指安奴或者其他14种的一个）看到了人子们要建造的塔和城市。\n6. And the Lord said, “Indeed the people are one, and they all have one language, and this is what they begin to do; now nothing that they propose to do will be withheld from them.\n主说：“人类聚集在一起并且理解彼此，他们都说同一种语言，他们开始这样做了，那么什么都不能让他们停下。\n7. Come, let Us go down and there confuse their language, that they may not understand one another’s speech.”\n来（外典里，他尤其指跟加百列说），我们混淆他们的语言，这样他们就不能理解他人在说什么，为什么在做什么。“\n8. So the Lord scattered them abroad from there over the face of all the earth, and they ceased building the city.\n所以，也就如此，人们再次分散在世界各地，他们停止建造城市了。\n9. Therefore its name is called Babel, because there the Lord confused the language of all the earth; and from there the Lord scattered them abroad over the face of all the earth.\n也就所以，天上的主混淆了所有世界上的语言，使得人们离彼此越来越远直到分散到大地的任何一处。而那座塔，叫巴别塔（意译就是通往天堂的塔）\n— Genesis 11:4–9\n创世纪 11:4-9", "like": 7, "ctime": 1496080114, "rcount": 0, "ip": "", "images": [], "video_aid": "416309", "video_bvid": "BV1rx411F7yF", "video_title": "【OP】 Ar tonelico III", "video_desc": "魔塔大陆3 终结世界的少女诗歌 OP", "video_owner": "秋名山退役车神", "video_view": 19767, "video_reply": 68, "video_n1": 40, "video_n2": 28}
